{
  "uid": "sensorhub",
  "title": "SensorHub",
  "tags": [
    "sensorhub"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Ingestão (API)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Leituras ingeridas/s",
      "description": "Leituras aceitas e rejeitadas pela API. 'rejected' alto = dispositivos mandando dado inválido.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (result)(rate(sensorhub_ingest_readings_total[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência do POST /api/readings/batch (p50 / p99)",
      "description": "A API só valida e publica: a latência é o tempo até o broker confirmar (acks=all).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le)(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=\"api/readings/batch\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le)(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route=\"api/readings/batch\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tempo até o Kafka confirmar (p50 / p99)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le)(rate(sensorhub_ingest_publish_duration_milliseconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le)(rate(sensorhub_ingest_publish_duration_milliseconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "LAG DO CONSUMER: a métrica mais importante",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lag por consumer group (medido dentro do consumer)",
      "description": "Mensagens no Kafka que o grupo ainda não commitou. Lag crescendo = o consumer não acompanha a ingestão. É o amortecedor do sistema: pico → lag sobe → drena.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (group)(sensorhub_consumer_lag)",
          "legendFormat": "{{group}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10000
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Lag por consumer group (medido pelo broker, kafka-exporter)",
      "description": "Mesma medida vista DE FORA. Se todos os consumers de um grupo morrerem, o gauge interno some, mas este continua subindo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (consumergroup)(kafka_consumergroup_lag)",
          "legendFormat": "{{consumergroup}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10000
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
